      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Here's a video showing this thing as best I could.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ljR2LV1QzRw\nIt's located in worldspace - so it stays put and you can move around it. It's not related to the avatar worn, nor the world that you're in. It may be present in every world, but specific conditions are required to see it.\nI feel like it's the earmuff ring assets that show the bounds, being made invisible and stored when not being actively shown.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
