      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have been on this journey while debugging my shaders.\n\nThis journey made me sad. :(\n\nhttps://github.com/AcChosen/TestRepository/blob/main/NewUnlitShader.shader \n\nCan easily test with this simple transparency shader.\n\nCan confirm it is affected by the earmuffs UI. The VRChat Camera also confirms this. As it is a camera that does not render the earmuffs UI.",
